# Assault troops: one volley close in, then the bayonet.
drill "Shock"
about "One volley close in, then the bayonet. Never waits, rarely breaks."
type Grenadier
dials aggression 0.95 discipline 0.60 cohesion 0.70 cover 0.10 patience 0.25 nerve 0.85

sergeant:
  when enemy within 42 and not enemy outnumbers us by 45% -> charge

man:
  otherwise -> follow sergeant
